<title>NETHERLANDS: Fortis 9 mth net up 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Fortis 9 mth net up 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>UTRECHT, Netherlands 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First 9 months 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of ecus unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   554    vs 469</p>
<p>    Pre-tax operating profit		 863    vs 742</p>
<p>Note - Analysts expected Dutch-Belgian financial group Fortis to post a profit rise of 17 percent to 549.2 million ecus in the first nine months of 1996.</p>
</text>
